  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Vocabulario del dinero**",
      "",
      "| Verbo | Significado | Ejemplo |",
      "|---|---|---|",
      "| *earn* | ganar trabajando | *She **earns** €2,000 a month.* |",
      "| *win* | ganar un premio | *He **won** the lottery.* |",
      "| *save* | ahorrar | *I **save** €200 a month.* |",
      "| *spend* | gastar | *We **spend** a lot on food.* |",
      "| *waste* | malgastar | *Don't **waste** money.* |",
      "| *borrow* | **pedir** prestado | *Can I **borrow** your pen?* |",
      "| *lend* | **prestar** | *Can you **lend** me €10?* |",
      "| *owe* | deber | *I **owe** him €50.* |",
      "| *pay back / pay off* | devolver / liquidar | *I'll **pay** you **back**.* |",
      "| *invest* | invertir | *Invest in your future.* |",
      "",
      "**Borrow vs lend:** quien **recibe** el dinero *borrows*; quien lo **da** *lends*. ✘ *Can you borrow me?* → ✔ *Can you **lend** me?*",
      "",
      "**Sustantivos:** *income (ingresos) · expenses (gastos) · savings (ahorros) · debt (deuda) · loan (préstamo) · interest (interés) · mortgage (hipoteca) · bill (factura) · rent (alquiler).*",
      "",
      "**Expresiones:** *make ends meet (llegar a fin de mes) · be broke (estar sin blanca) · cost an arm and a leg (costar un riñón) · save up for … · a bargain (una ganga) · to be worth it.*",
      "",
      "**Ojo — falsos amigos y ortografía:** *salary* (sueldo mensual), *wage* (por hora), *fee* (honorarios, tasa), *fine* (multa), *cash* (efectivo). *Money* es incontable: *some money*, no *a money*. *Pay by card / in cash*.",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *borrow* /ˈbɒrəʊ/ · *invest* /ɪnˈvest/ · *mortgage* /ˈmɔːɡɪdʒ/ (la 't' no suena)."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "Can you borrow me money?",
        "right": "Can you lend me money?",
        "note": "Lend = dar prestado."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "I have a lot of moneys.",
        "right": "I have a lot of money.",
        "note": "Money incontable."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": [
